TurkicOCR-SVTRv2-B is an independent recognizer project based on the SVTRv2-B/OpenOCR training path and adapted for Turkic Cyrillic OCR from zone-grounded document crops.

Training dataset: alenisaw/turkicocr-cyrillic, CC-BY-4.0 license, DOI: 10.57967/hf/9255.

